  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark technical art direction, restrained cyan/red/yellow palette, crisp ledger structure, and clear ROI focal treatment. Desktop composition is polished, but tablet and mobile degrade: the headline wraps awkwardly, supporting copy and labels become very small, the stacked cards create a long dense column, and the mobile header visibly clips most navigation while losing the wordmark and red-mode control. Header contrast also remains unproven by the serious incomplete checks across 14–26 nodes.",
    "fix": "Recompose the headline per breakpoint, raise small-text size/contrast, tighten mobile card spacing, and replace the clipped horizontal header with an explicit compact navigation pattern that preserves brand and mode controls.",
